        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINPRT, Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIntricately detailed, the Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose features a fanciful design that is dripping with elegance. The Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. The scroll embellishments of the Windsor Leverset will surely add glamor to your home. The distinctive ornate pattern makes this leverset the perfect choice for any classic american restoration or remodeling project. The Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-windsor-series\"><b>Windsor Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur WINPRT Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-plate.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose",
                "description": "Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose, Grandeur WINPRT - Intricately detailed, the Ornate Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose features a fanciful design that is dripping with elegance. The Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. The scroll embellishments of the Windsor Leverset will surely add glamor to your home. The distinctive ornate pattern makes this leverset the perfect choice for any classic american restoration or remodeling project. The Portofino Lever With Windsor Rose will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
